videos.script:
This time the app is yours. {{yours}}

You take a web app you wrote, choose one route to one more platform, and write down why. The note is short, and it is the part people will ask about. {{note}}

Then a release, the way the planner's was made: a tagged commit, the packages, a list of checksums with your signature on it, and notes for people. {{release}} And then you check it the way a stranger would. {{check}}

Last, where it goes: a README, a release page, your portfolio. And a list to go through before you call it done. {{done}}
